# R106: a dasham stored into a whole-number mala is converted exactly, as into a vitti: 3.0
# stores 3. One with a fraction stops the program with E_DASHAM_VITTI. (It used to store the
# IEEE-754 bits: 3.0 read back as 4613937818241073152.)
mukhya() {
    dasham d = 3.0
    vitti a[2]
    a[0] = d
    likha(a[0])
    a[1] = d * 2.5
    likha(a[1])
}
